             EXAMPLES OF INFORMATION AVAILABLE FROM LC MARVEL

Anyone interested in government information will find a wide variety of
material available from LC MARVEL.  A quick search turned up the following:
     Congressional phone and fax numbers
     Congressional committee assignments
     Presidential documents
     White House press releases
     Supreme Court decisions
     Text of Clinton Administration's FY93 budget proposal (by section)
     FCC documents
     Listing of federal bulletin board systems
     Articles from the _Library of Congress Information Bulletin_
     _Catalog of Federal Domestic Assistance_, searchable by keyword
     _Federal Register_ (excerpts only; full text available only by
          subscription)

Since LC MARVEL is a Gopher system, articles can be mailed directly to your
e-mail address.

